	(text "Asymmetric half-bridge for the tooth-clutch coil (~24 Ohm, 1.5 A pull-in, 0.2-0.4 A hold).\n  Engage/hold: Q_LS on, PWM Q_HS. Off-time current recirculates Q_LS -> R_SHUNT -> D_FW2 (slow decay),\n  so the shunt sees the coil current continuously and ADC1 reads the average.\n  Release: both off -> coil sees -36 V through D_FW2/D_FW1, energy returns to the bus (fast decay).\nPTC limits the damage if firmware ever leaves the coil fully on."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 30.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a0b54c87-654c-50ce-ba25-9a9c31415088")
	)
